# Files Cloudflare Pages should not upload as public assets.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE TRUSTING IT (S2, 2026-07-24): this file is NOT the control
# that keeps anything private on this project. `.cursor/` has been listed below
# since June and https://flightway.ai/.cursor/rules/jacob-work-prototype.mdc
# still answered 200 — `.assetsignore` is honoured by direct
# `wrangler pages deploy` uploads, and this project is built by the GitHub
# integration instead. Every entry here therefore ALSO needs a rule in
# `_redirects`, which is evaluated at request time and demonstrably works.
# Kept as a second line (and as the fix if the deploy path ever changes back),
# never as the only one.
.onet-cache/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
.cursor/

# S2 (V2): served 200 on live flightway.ai. Values are placeholders, but the
# variable NAMES are a map of every secret this deployment reads — a free
# enumeration of what to go phishing for. Also 302'd in _redirects.
.dev.vars.example

# Local gate/QA output. Gitignored today, so normally absent from the build —
# listed so a stray committed run can never become a public directory.
.gates/
.screenshots/
.smoke-playwright/
.tmp-probe/
.wrangler/
.github/
.claude/
